Z||000007||JetroGT||06-11-2001||06:27 PM||||I'm back for a short break. I worked all weekend and scooped up alot of double time.<BR>Any way, I got the details about the Alamo show.<P> <BR>This years event has been forced to be rescheduled due to the fact the "Pres" of the Alamo Area Fiero Owners is Military and his presence has been "Requested" in the Middle East for a short time.  Due to this fact, the original date of April 7th and 8th has been changed to the month of June.  <BR>If  you have any further questions, just email me at aafosatx@msn.com.<BR>Thanks, <BR>Rob<BR> <BR>UPDATE!!!!!<BR>Rooms at the Best Western listed below have been blocked and a limited amount are currently available, BUT only until the 29th of May!  If you plan to attend from out of town, I strongly suggest you make your reservations now to ensure you get a room at the $52.00 rate per night.  <BR>See you in June!<BR> <BR>June 30th and July 1st<BR>Lodging provided at Best Western Lackland Inns and Suite <BR>6815 Highway 90 West  San Antonio Tx  78227<BR>210-675-9690<BR>Block of Rooms set aside at discounted rates for Fiero Owners<BR>You must call and reserve a room from this Block of Rooms to <BR>secure the discounted rate<BR>Parking will be set aside for those staying at the Hotel<BR> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/JetroGTsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
